<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All the burdens of the day,</l><l>All the words which I shall say,</l><l>All the works my God may send,</l><l>All the hours in rest I spend:</l><l>Ever for His glory living,</l><l>Blessing, praise and honor giving!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Every blood-drop in the heart,</l><l>Every grief and aching smart,</l><l>Every bitter pulse of pain,</l><l>Every hour of joy again:</l><l>Only for God’s glory living,</l><l>Blessing, praise and honor giving!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>As I take my daily food,</l><l>Greet another on life’s road,</l><l>Pluck a flower beside the way,</l><l>Stoop to lift a wisp of hay:</l><l>Ever for God’s glory living,</l><l>Blessing, praise and honor giving!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>All, from deeds of little worth,</l><l>To the greatest things on earth;</l><l>Mine to build some world to be,</l><l>Or to lie and gaze on Thee:</l><l>For Thy glory daily living,</l><l>Blessing, praise and honor giving!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
